    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy though. like you're just playing a game that has no prize at the end. i look at things and i just think... why bother? why keep trying to fill this void when it's just going to come back harder next time something else dies or leaves? it feels like it would be more peaceful to just stop trying to fight the emptiness and just... let it happen.",
